#. i18n: file kcmkttsmgr/addtalkerwidget.ui line 16
#: kcmkttsmgr/kcmkttsmgr.cpp:1220 rc.cpp:9
#, no-c-format
msgid "Add Talker"
msgstr "Snacker tofögen"

#. i18n: file kcmkttsmgr/addtalkerwidget.ui line 49
#: rc.cpp:13 rc.cpp:22
#, no-c-format
msgid "Select the speech synthesizer to do the speaking."
msgstr "Blicksnuut för't Vörlesen utsöken."

#. i18n: file kcmkttsmgr/addtalkerwidget.ui line 69
#: rc.cpp:16 rc.cpp:34
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select the language to be spoken.  Note that after you configure a Talker, your "
"chosen Language may be overridden by the synthesizer, depending upon the "
"options you choose."
msgstr ""
"Söök de Spraak för de Blicksnuut ut. Beacht, dat de Blicksnuut-Instellen, "
"afhangig vun de utsöcht Optschonen, Dien Spraakutwahl överschrieven kann, "
"nadeem Du en Snacker utsöcht hest."

#. i18n: file kcmkttsmgr/addtalkerwidget.ui line 95
#: rc.cpp:19 rc.cpp:438
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Synthesizer:"
msgstr "&Blicksnuut:"

#. i18n: file kcmkttsmgr/addtalkerwidget.ui line 186
#: rc.cpp:25
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show All"
msgstr "All wiesen"

#. i18n: file kcmkttsmgr/addtalkerwidget.ui line 192
#: rc.cpp:28
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The radio buttons below determine which box shows all possibilities.  The box "
"to the left of the checked button shows all possibilities.  The box to the left "
"of the unchecked box only shows those possibilities that match the other box."
msgstr ""
"Mit de Utwahlknööp nerrn lett sik fastleggen, welk Feld all Mööglichkeiten "
"wiest. Dat Feld linkerhand vun den anmaakt Knoop wiest all Mööglichkeiten. Dat "
"Feld linkerhand den utmaakt Knoop wiest bloots de utsöchten Mööglichkeiten "
"binnen dat anner Feld."

#. i18n: file kcmkttsmgr/addtalkerwidget.ui line 200
#: rc.cpp:31 rc.cpp:458
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Language:"
msgstr "&Spraak:"

#. i18n: file kcmkttsmgr/addtalkerwidget.ui line 227
#: rc.cpp:38
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Check to list all the possible languages in the Language box at the left.  When "
"a language has been chosen, the Synthesizer box will show only those "
"synthesizers that can speak in the chosen language."
msgstr ""
"Maak dit an, wenn Du all Spraken binnen dat Utwahlfeld links wiesen wullt. Wenn "
"en Spraak utsöcht is, wiest dat Utwahlfeld vun de Blicksnuut bloots de "
"Vörlesers, de disse Spraak ünnerstütt."

#. i18n: file kcmkttsmgr/addtalkerwidget.ui line 241
#: rc.cpp:42
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Check this box to display all the available synthesizers in the Synthesizer box "
"to the left.  When a synthesizer is chosen, only the languages that can be "
"spoken by that synthesizer appear in the Language box."
msgstr ""
"Maak dit an, wenn Du all Vörlesers links binnen dat Utwahlfeld för de "
"Blicksnuut wiesen wullt. Wenn en Vörleser utsöcht is, wiest dat Utwahlfeld vun "
"de Blicksnuut bloots de Spraken, de disse Vörleser ünnerstütt."

#. i18n: file kcmkttsmgr/kcmkttsmgrwidget.ui line 45
#: rc.cpp:45
#, no-c-format
msgid "&General"
msgstr "&Allgemeen"

#. i18n: file kcmkttsmgr/kcmkttsmgrwidget.ui line 56
#: rc.cpp:48
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Enable Text-to-Speech System (KTTSD)"
msgstr "&Blicksnuut anmaken (KTTSD)"

#. i18n: file kcmkttsmgr/kcmkttsmgrwidget.ui line 59
#: rc.cpp:51
#, no-c-format
msgid "Check to start the KTTS Deamon and enable Text-to-Speech."
msgstr "Maak dit an, wenn Du den KTTS-Dämoon un de Blicksnuut starten wullt."

#. i18n: file kcmkttsmgr/kcmkttsmgrwidget.ui line 67
#: rc.cpp:54
#, no-c-format
msgid "Always em&bed Text-to-Speech Manager in system tray"
msgstr "Blicksnuut-Pleger jümmers na den Systeemafsnitt &inbedden"

#. i18n: file kcmkttsmgr/kcmkttsmgrwidget.ui line 73
#: rc.cpp:57
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When checked, KTTSMgr displays an icon in the system tray, and clicking OK or "
"Cancel buttons does not stop KTTSMgr.  Use system tray context menu to quit "
"KTTSMgr.  This setting takes effect when KTTSMgr is next started.  This setting "
"has no effect when running in the KDE Control Center."
msgstr ""
"Wenn anmaakt, wiest \"KTTSMgr\" en Lüttbild binnen den Systeemafsnitt, un wenn "
"Een op \"OK\" oder \"Afbreken\" klickt, löppt \"KTTSMgr\" wieder. Bruuk dat "
"Systeemafsnitt-Rechtsklickmenü, wenn Du \"KTTSMgr\" verlaten wullt. Disse "
"Instellen warrt eerst na en Niegstart vun \"KTTSMgr\" övernahmen, un hett keen "
"Utwarken, wenn \"KTTSMgr\" in'n Kuntrullzentrum löppt."

#. i18n: file kcmkttsmgr/kcmkttsmgrwidget.ui line 123
#: rc.cpp:60
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show &main window on startup"
msgstr "&Hööftfinster bi't Hoochfohren wiesen"

#. i18n: file kcmkttsmgr/kcmkttsmgrwidget.ui line 129
#: rc.cpp:63
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When checked, the KTTSMgr window is displayed when KTTSMgr starts.  When "
"unchecked, click on the icon in the system tray to display the KTTSMgr window."
msgstr ""
"Wenn dit anmaakt is, warrt wielt en Start vun KTTSMgr dat KTTSMgr-Finster "
"wiest. Wenn dit utmaakt is, klick op dat Lüttbild binnen den Systeemafsnitt, "
"wenn Du dat KTTSMgr-Finster opmaken wullt."

#. i18n: file kcmkttsmgr/kcmkttsmgrwidget.ui line 164
#: rc.cpp:66
#, no-c-format
msgid "E&xit when speaking is finished"
msgstr "&Beennen, wenn de Vörleser fardig is"

#. i18n: file kcmkttsmgr/kcmkttsmgrwidget.ui line 170
#: rc.cpp:69
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When checked, and KTTSMgr was automatically started when speech began, "
"automatically exits when speech has finished.  Does not automatically exit if "
"KTTSMgr was started manually or started from the Control Center."
msgstr ""
"Wenn dit anmaakt is un KTTSMgr automaatsch för de Blicksnuut start wöör, warrt "
"KTTSMgr wedder beendt, wenn de Vörleser fardig is. Wenn KTTSMgr vun Hand oder "
"vun dat Kuntrullzentrum ut start wöör, warrt KTTSMgr nich automaatsch beendt."

#. i18n: file kcmkttsmgr/kcmkttsmgrwidget.ui line 180
#: rc.cpp:72
#, no-c-format
msgid "Sta&rt minimized in system tray when speaking"
msgstr "Bi't Vörlesen minimeert binnen den Systeemafsnitt &starten"

#. i18n: file kcmkttsmgr/kcmkttsmgrwidget.ui line 186
#: rc.cpp:75
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When checked, if KTTSMgr is not already running and speech begins, starts "
"KTTSMgr and displays an icon in the system tray.  <em>Note<em>"
": KTTSMgr only automatically starts for text jobs having 5 sentences or more."
msgstr ""
"Wenn dit anmaakt is, wenn KTTSMgr noch nich löppt, warrt KTTSMgr start, de "
"Vörleser fangt an, un en Lüttbild warrt binnen den Systeemafsnitt wiest. <em>"
"Henwies</em>: KTTSMgr warrt bloots för Text mit tominnst fief Sätz automaatsch "
"start."

