#. i18n: file kcmkttsmgr/kcmkttsmgrwidget.ui line 284
#: rc.cpp:102 rc.cpp:496
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is a list of all the configured Talkers.  A Talker is a speech synthesizer "
"that has been configured with a language, voice, gender, speaking rate, and "
"volume.  Talkers higher in the list have higher priority.  The topmost Talker "
"will be used when no talker attributes have been specified by an application."
msgstr ""
"Dit is de List mit all instellt Snackers. En Snacker is en Blicksnuut mit "
"instellt Spraak, Stimm, Geslecht, Spraak-Gauheit un Luutstärk. Snackers mehr "
"baven op de List hebbt höger Prioriteet. För Programmen ahn fastleggt Snacker "
"warrt de böverst Snacker bruukt."

#. i18n: file kcmkttsmgr/kcmkttsmgrwidget.ui line 308
