"vörleest."

#. i18n: file kcmkttsmgr/kcmkttsmgrwidget.ui line 813
#: rc.cpp:233
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Filters"
msgstr "&Filtern"

#. i18n: file kcmkttsmgr/kcmkttsmgrwidget.ui line 830
#: kcmkttsmgr/kcmkttsmgr.cpp:1437 rc.cpp:236
#, no-c-format
msgid "Filter"
msgstr "Filter"

#. i18n: file kcmkttsmgr/kcmkttsmgrwidget.ui line 846
#: rc.cpp:239
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is a list of all the configured Filters.  Filters higher in the list are "
"applied first.  Filters modify text before it is spoken.  They can be used to "
"substitute for mispronounced words, transform XML from one form to another, or "
"change the default Talker to be used for speech output."
msgstr ""
"Dit is en List mit all instellt Filters. De Filters mehr baven in de List warrt "
"toeerst anwendt. Filters ännert den Text, ehr he vörleest warrt. Ehr laat sik "
"för't Utwesseln vun leeg schreven Wöör bruken, för't Ümwanneln vun XML na en "
"anner Format, oder för't Ännern vun de Blicksnuut ehr Standard-Snacker ."

#. i18n: file kcmkttsmgr/kcmkttsmgrwidget.ui line 876
#: rc.cpp:246
#, no-c-format
msgid "Click to add and configure a new Filter."
msgstr "Klick hier, wenn Du en niegen Filter tofögen un instellen wullt."

#. i18n: file kcmkttsmgr/kcmkttsmgrwidget.ui line 896
#: rc.cpp:252
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click to move selected filter up in the list.  Filters higher in the list are "
"applied first."
msgstr ""
"Klick hier, wenn Du en markeert Filter in de List na baven schuven wullt. "
"Filter, de mehr baven in de List staht, warrt toeerst anwendt."

#. i18n: file kcmkttsmgr/kcmkttsmgrwidget.ui line 915
#: rc.cpp:258
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click to move a filter down in the list.  Filters lower in the list are applied "
"last."
msgstr ""
"Klick hier, wenn Du en markeert Filter in de List na nerrn schuven wullt. "
"Filter, de mehr nerrn in de List staht, warrt tolest anwendt."

#. i18n: file kcmkttsmgr/kcmkttsmgrwidget.ui line 940
#: rc.cpp:264
#, no-c-format
msgid "Click to configure options for the highlighted Filter."
msgstr ""
"Klick hier, wenn Du de Optschonen för den rutheevt Filter instellen wullt."

#. i18n: file kcmkttsmgr/kcmkttsmgrwidget.ui line 965
#: rc.cpp:270
#, no-c-format
msgid "Click to remove the highlighted Filter."
msgstr "Klick hier, wenn Du den rutheevt Filter wegdoon wullt."

#. i18n: file kcmkttsmgr/kcmkttsmgrwidget.ui line 1000
#: rc.cpp:273
#, no-c-format
msgid "Sentence Boundary Detector"
msgstr "Satzgrenz-Faststellen"

#. i18n: file kcmkttsmgr/kcmkttsmgrwidget.ui line 1016
#: rc.cpp:276
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is a list of all the configured Sentence Boundary Detector (SBD) Filters.  "
"SBDs break long text jobs up into sentences, which reduces the time before a "
"job begins speaking, and permits you to advance or rewind through a job.  SBDs "
"are applied in the order listed (top to bottom) after all the normal filters at "
"the top of this screen have been applied.  Filtering stops when the first SBD "
"modifies the text."
msgstr ""
"Dit is en List mit instellt Filters för de Satzgrenz-Faststellen (SGF). SGFs "
